  "pairs_note": "Structure and composed task surfaces map exact spec selectors to their stable GTK widget names. Tasks12 TOOL triage approves selector pairs for whole task cards, whose completion/title/actions have separate GTK targets. All descendants, inventory and tolerances remain measured.",
  "implementation_note": "Twenty v70 states; stable GTK names and fixture-only draft/query startup modes. Shared destinations, marks, row avatars, progress, text modes, section tally and BarEntry adopted. Pending measured kit parity is recorded in Tasks kit requests; no parity claimed until all four variants PASS."
